      "description": "The copy loop advances `i` as it consumes line bytes from `m_cache`, but the vulnerable code never checks `i == buffer.size()` and grows `buffer`. On the witnessed full-file line, this leaves `i` equal to the 16-byte allocation extent before the function performs another write."
